It's medium because the PPI data and pricing power history align, yet sector rotation risk remains

00:03:39.060 --> 00:03:45.400
if growth stocks rebound sharply. This trade demonstrates how to screen for inflation resilient names

00:03:45.400 --> 00:03:51.360
using public economic releases rather than hype. Before we check how last week's trade performed,

00:03:51.580 --> 00:03:57.580
here's the lesson we're carrying forward. Last week's simulated hold in Eli Lilly entered

00:03:57.580 --> 00:04:06.700
